I agree with David Rhead that there is a definite need for a division of =
a
book in front matter, body and back matter. In fact, last summer I =
suggested
that we start defining the structure of every class of documents for =
which we
will make a document style in SGML-like terms. Existing SGML dtd's for =
books
already contain the division David suggested.

And yes, David, I'd be interested in reading your more detailed =
suggestions,


Nico


